---
// How it works — animated 4-stage pipeline. Horizontal on desktop, stacked full-width cards on mobile.
---

<section class="how" aria-label="How ChangeOps works">
  <div class="flow-head shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2>From the logs Azure already writes to a sealed record</h2>
    <p class="lead">Connect, collect, record, seal. Your engineers, agents and auditors read from the same ledger.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pipe shell">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="cloud">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 50"><path d="M20 42 a14 14 0 0 1 2-27 a18 18 0 0 1 34 4 a12 12 0 0 1 2 23 z" fill="none" stroke="#35e0c8" stroke-width="2.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="ring"></span><span class="ring r2"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="stxt">
        <div class="step">01 · CONNECT</div>
        <h3>Approve one app, assign Reader</h3>
        <p class="sp">No secret exchanged or held, nothing installed. Federated identity, the Reader role or a narrower one, revoked from your own portal.</p>
        <div class="road"><b>Read-only</b> forever</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conn" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span></div>

    <div class="stage">
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip c1">Activity Log</span>
          <span class="chip c2">Resource Graph changes</span>
          <span class="chip c3">Entra ID audit</span>
          <span class="chip c4">AKS · Key Vault audit</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stxt">
        <div class="step">02 · COLLECT</div>
        <h3>Read the logs Azure already writes</h3>
        <p class="sp">Activity Log, Resource Graph and Entra ID with consent alone. Kubernetes and Key Vault through your own Event Hub or Log Analytics workspace.</p>
        <div class="road"><b>Raw logs</b> read, kept only inside frozen packs</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conn" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span></div>

    <div class="stage">
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="merge">
          <span class="src s1">Activity Log</span>
          <span class="src s2">Resource Graph</span>
          <span class="one">one record</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stxt">
        <div class="step">03 · RECORD</div>
        <h3>One record per change</h3>
        <p class="sp">When, where, what, who, the before and after, and a pointer to Azure's own record. The same change in two logs becomes one. Actors stay named after the identity is gone.</p>
        <div class="road"><b>Housekeeping churn</b> folded</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conn" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span><span class="pkt"></span></div>

    <div class="stage">
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="chain">
          <span class="blk">day −2</span><span class="lnk"></span><span class="blk">day −1</span><span class="lnk"></span><span class="blk now">today<i></i></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stxt">
        <div class="step">04 · SEAL</div>
        <h3>Sealed daily, served everywhere</h3>
        <p class="sp">Each day's records are hashed into one root, chained to the day before and stamped by an outside time authority. Web app, MCP, packs and the report read the same ledger.</p>
        <div class="road"><b>RFC 3161 anchor</b> · verify offline</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how { position: relative; padding: 48px var(--pad) 40px; background: rgba(8,12,22,.5); border-top: 1px solid #1a2336; }
  .flow-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .flow-head h2 { font-size: clamp(23px, 3vw, 29px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.15; text-wrap: balance; }
  .flow-head .lead { color: var(--muted-2); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }

  .pipe { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 46px 1fr 46px 1fr 46px 1.1fr; align-items: stretch; }
  .stage { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,24,40,.72), rgba(12,17,30,.82)); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .viz { height: 96px; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .step { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--accent); }
  .stage h3 { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; margin: 5px 0 3px; }
  .sp { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted-2); line-height: 1.45; }
  .road { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; color: #5b6678; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px dashed #222c40; }
  .stxt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
  .stxt .road { margin-top: auto; }
  .sp { margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .road b { color: var(--dim); }

  .conn { align-self: center; position: relative; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border), #2f3e5c, var(--border)); }
  .conn .pkt { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 0; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent); transform: translateY(-50%); animation: travel 2.1s linear infinite; }
  .conn .pkt:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .7s; }
  .conn .pkt:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.4s; }

  .cloud { width: 64px; height: 40px; position: relative; }
  .cloud svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(53,224,200,.4)); }
  .ring { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 30px; height: 30px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(53,224,200,.55); border-radius: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); animation: ringexp 2.6s ease-out infinite; }
  .ring.r2 { animation-delay: 1.3s; }

  .chips { width: 100%; height: 100%; position: relative; }
  .chip { position: absolute; left: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #2c3a55; background: rgba(20,28,46,.92); color: #9fb0c8; white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; }
  .chip.c1 { top: 2px; animation: chipin 4.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .chip.c2 { top: 26px; animation: chipin 4.8s ease-in-out infinite .8s; }
  .chip.c3 { top: 50px; animation: chipin 4.8s ease-in-out infinite 1.6s; }
  .chip.c4 { top: 74px; animation: chipin 4.8s ease-in-out infinite 2.4s; }

  .merge { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .src { position: absolute; top: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #2c3a55; background: rgba(20,28,46,.92); color: #9fb0c8; white-space: nowrap; animation: mergein 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .src.s1 { left: 4px; }
  .src.s2 { right: 4px; animation-delay: .25s; }
  .one { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 8px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #2c3a55; background: rgba(20,28,46,.95); color: #cdeee7; white-space: nowrap; animation: onepulse 4s ease-in-out infinite; }

  .chain { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .blk { position: relative; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; padding: 8px 9px; border: 1px solid #2c3a55; border-radius: 7px; background: rgba(20,28,46,.92); color: #9fb0c8; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lnk { width: 14px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2f3e5c, rgba(53,224,200,.7)); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .blk.now { color: #cdeee7; border-color: rgba(53,224,200,.5); animation: sealstamp 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .blk.now i { position: absolute; top: -5px; right: -5px; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent); animation: blip 2s ease-in-out infinite; }

  /* mobile: stacked full-width cards (viz on top, text below) with vertical connectors */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .pipe { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .conn { align-self: center; width: 2px; height: 30px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--border), #2f3e5c, var(--border)); }
    .conn .pkt { top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); animation-name: vtravel; animation-duration: 1.9s; }
    .conn .pkt:nth-child(2), .conn .pkt:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
  }

  /* desktop/landscape only: frosted-glass stage cards */
  @media (min-width: 861px) {
    .stage { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,24,40,.5), rgba(12,17,30,.58)); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
  }
</style>
